   "id": "chianti-classico",
   "why": {
    "text": "Hilly, shallow soils of shale and sandstone up to 700 m, with hot dry summers and big day-night swings, ripen Sangiovese slowly.",
    "cite": [
     "chianti-classico-disc:p4",
     "chianti-classico-disc:p11",
